er into focused modules, add breadcrumb [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]navigation to agent and family pages, and add the pytest flag that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rewrites the agents-sync markdown goldens.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Commit artifacts on agent and family pages[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]commits[dim] · [dim][/dim]after shell[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]commits: resolve the primary repository remote during inventory and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]render per-run and per-family commit tables whose SHAs link to the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hosted commit page when the remote is GitHub.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Published SASE output variables[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]vars[dim] · [dim][/dim]after shell[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vars: carry sanitized `output_variables` across the v2 wire under strict[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]validation, render them on agent and family pages, and restore them into[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]imported local artifacts.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Lane neighbors on agent and family pages[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]neighbors[dim] · [dim][/dim]after shell[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]neighbors: build the name-derived lane kinship projection for a hood [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]snapshot and render the Neighbors section with ancestor, descendant, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hood-group rows that link to their pages.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Whole-page integration, docs, and consistency pass[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after commits, vars, neighbors[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]polish: add the all-sections integration golden, reconcile section order[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and anchors across the three feature phases, and document the complete [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]page anatomy.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-a9","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-a9.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-75ba345033f282e84500d8560404a9ad","started_at":"2026-07-27T20:39:21.952842+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1785187778,"sha":"11ddd277631aa24521c24e4d8d484d904a704e54","subject":"feat(agents-sync): publish linked commit artifacts (sase-a9.2)"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"865f8d423b38c0850b34ffa3ff38ba7910e3a3015f88432ed2f148c8b99d0353","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a9.2/chat.md","size_bytes":8156},"commits":{"digest":"bd0c432cf9c4b1ae8375ca4429db600dde29a5628cd5500aa8e6521c6e747ad5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a9.2/commits.json","size_bytes":240},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a9.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"63f615da65160755437c379f1b98231459040e442e67ded7460e5048222c8190","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a9.2/meta.json","size_bytes":603},"prompt":{"digest":"ff08dbd03b50d31250b420ab4cc9e8d135f99667016fd7a41990b3b7aeaf01af","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a9.2/prompt.md","size_bytes":154},"state":{"digest":"1e27115321b4cf1867c87bd74ed44007891963dab710bb26ccca79f20ecb4563","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a9.2/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-a9.2","local_name":"sase-a9.2","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-a9","agent_clan_generation":"20260727163905